---
import { Github, Terminal, Heart } from "lucide-astro";
---

<footer
  class="mt-auto border-t border-white/5 bg-[#0B0D13]/90 pt-16 pb-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
>
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"
  >
    <!-- Brand Info -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div
          class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-linear-to-br from-[#6EBEB4] to-[#3B82F6] p-px"
        >
          <div
            class="w-full h-full bg-[#0B0D13] rounded-[7px] flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#6EBEB4] text-xs">ri</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="font-bold text-lg text-white font-mono">rico</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono text-center md:text-left mt-1">
        最小化的 Rust Coding Agent · 毫秒必争，原生终端。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Philosophy Tagline -->
    <div
      class="text-center font-mono text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5 max-w-md"
    >
      <span class="text-[#6EBEB4] font-semibold">DRY &amp; KISS</span>:
      代码首先服务于读者，其次才交给机器执行。
    </div>

    <!-- Links & Copyright -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/Neonity2020/rico"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <Github class="w-4 h-4" />
        <span>GitHub</span>
      </a>
      <span>MIT License</span>
      <span>© 2026 rico</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
